\fs28 \cf5 \cb12 \ul \ulc5 IntLiteral}} and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://docs.modular.com/stable/mojo/std/builtin/float_literal/FloatLiteral/"}}{\fldrslt 
\fs28 \cf5 \cb12 \ul \ulc5 FloatLiteral}}.\
These literal types are used at compile time to represent literal numbers that appear in the code. In general, you should never instantiate these types yourself.\
